cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. The corpus it produced is a separate object with its own DOI."
title: "Landing Copy Grader: a deterministic 0-100 rubric for landing page hero copy"
abstract: "Scores the hero copy of a landing page (headline, sub-headline, call-to-action) from 0 to 100 against a fixed rule set: no LLM, no backend, no network call, so the same input always yields the same score. It is a linter for stylistic tells, not a ground-truth AI detector, and has not been validated against human judgement."
type: software
authors:
